<title>USA: Goldman Sachs wins $150 mln GTE unit's debt.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs wins $150 mln GTE unit's debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was won on Tuesday via competitive bid of 7.53301 percent by Goldman Sachs &amp; Co, according to a Goldman spokesperson.</p>
<p>BORROWER GTE HAWAIIAN TELEPHONE</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	    COUPON 7.375 PCT    MATURITY 09/01/06</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES	 ISS PRICE 99.202    PAY DATE 09/13/96</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BAA2	 REOFFER 99.202	PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS     YIELD 7.489 PCT     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>INDUSTRY UTILITIES    SPREAD 57 BP</p>
<p>NOTE GTE CORP UNIT</p>
<p>--U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
